WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Since Miss Jian said this herself,

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,860
It’s a shame that Mr. Shen failed to live up to Miss Jian’s wishes.

3
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:10,790
Please ask Miss Jian to work hard in Donghuang from now on.

4
00:00:10,790 --> 00:00:15,050
Thank you, Mr. Shen

5
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:25,940
I told you to get out, get out

6
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:29,150
Don't catch my eye again

7
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:30,350
are you okay

8
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:32,950
Lu said that person has never been nosy.

9
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:35,880
I heard Mr. Shen took you away

10
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:37,440
you are trembling

11
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:38,930
I'm fine

12
00:00:38,930 --> 00:00:41,630
Are you too hungry?

13
00:00:41,630 --> 00:00:42,830
I'll take you to have something to eat

14
00:00:42,830 --> 00:00:45,490
I don’t have to go to work today.

15
00:00:45,490 --> 00:00:46,490
The company has a canteen

16
00:00:46,490 --> 00:00:49,790
You must have been a very confident person in the past, right?

17
00:00:49,790 --> 00:00:51,290
Once upon a time

18
00:00:51,290 --> 00:00:52,590
It seems like it happened a lifetime ago

19
00:00:52,590 --> 00:00:54,190
Mr. Lu asked me to give it to you

20
00:00:54,190 --> 00:00:55,390
so much
